        {
          "sid": "clothing-t1-s07",
          "c": "出街記得戴帽。",
          "j": "ceot1 gaai1 gei3 dak1 daai3 mou2.",
          "e": "Remember to wear a hat when you go out.",
          "note": "Cantonese has two verbs for \"wear\". <strong>著</strong> (zoek3) is for clothes you put your body into — 著衫 (zoek3 saam1), 著鞋 (zoek3 haai4). <strong>戴</strong> (daai3) is for things you put on — 戴帽 (daai3 mou2) a hat, 戴手錶 (daai3 sau2 biu1) a watch.",
